     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: CodeSystem ng-hiv-int-lab-form-cs</b></p><a name=\"ng-hiv-int-lab-form-cs\"> </a><a name=\"hcng-hiv-int-lab-form-cs\"> </a><p>This case-sensitive code system <code>https://fhir-ig.digitalhealth.gov.ng/CodeSystem/ng-hiv-int-lab-form-cs</code> defines the following codes:</p><table class=\"codes\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td><td><b>Definition</b></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">test-type-viral-load<a name=\"ng-hiv-int-lab-form-cs-test-type-viral-load\"> </a></td><td>Viral load</td><td>A viral-load test is requested.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">test-type-eid<a name=\"ng-hiv-int-lab-form-cs-test-type-eid\"> </a></td><td>Early infant diagnosis</td><td>An early-infant-diagnosis test is requested.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">test-type-other<a name=\"ng-hiv-int-lab-form-cs-test-type-other\"> </a></td><td>Other laboratory test</td><td>One or more other laboratory investigations are requested.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">eid-age-less-than-or-equal-72-hours<a name=\"ng-hiv-int-lab-form-cs-eid-age-less-than-or-equal-72-hours\"> </a></td><td>72 hours or younger</td><td>Infant age is 72 hours or younger at specimen collection.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">eid-age-over-72-hours-under-2-months<a name=\"ng-hiv-int-lab-form-cs-eid-age-over-72-hours-under-2-months\"> </a></td><td>Older than 72 hours and younger than 2 months</td><td>Infant age is greater than 72 hours and less than 2 months.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">eid-age-2-to-12-months<a name=\"ng-hiv-int-lab-form-cs-eid-age-2-to-12-months\"> </a></td><td>2 to 12 months</td><td>Infant age is at least 2 months and not more than 12 months.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">eid-age-over-12-months<a name=\"ng-hiv-int-lab-form-cs-eid-age-over-12-months\"> </a></td><td>Older than 12 months</td><td>Infant age is greater than 12 months.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">arv-prophylaxis-azt-nvp<a name=\"ng-hiv-int-lab-form-cs-arv-prophylaxis-azt-nvp\"> </a></td><td>AZT + NVP</td><td>Zidovudine and nevirapine prophylaxis.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">arv-prophylaxis-nvp<a name=\"ng-hiv-int-lab-form-cs-arv-prophylaxis-nvp\"> </a></td><td>NVP</td><td>Nevirapine prophylaxis.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">arv-prophylaxis-azt-3tc-nvp-ral<a name=\"ng-hiv-int-lab-form-cs-arv-prophylaxis-azt-3tc-nvp-ral\"> </a></td><td>AZT + 3TC + NVP/RAL</td><td>Zidovudine, lamivudine and nevirapine or raltegravir prophylaxis as printed on the source form.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">arv-prophylaxis-other<a name=\"ng-hiv-int-lab-form-cs-arv-prophylaxis-other\"> </a></td><td>Other ARV prophylaxis</td><td>An ARV-prophylaxis regimen not represented by another code; specify separately.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">arv-prophylaxis-none<a name=\"ng-hiv-int-lab-form-cs-arv-prophylaxis-none\"> </a></td><td>No ARV prophylaxis</td><td>No ARV prophylaxis was received.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">regimen-line-first<a name=\"ng-hiv-int-lab-form-cs-regimen-line-first\"> </a></td><td>First-line regimen</td><td>The client is receiving a first-line ART regimen.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">regimen-line-second<a name=\"ng-hiv-int-lab-form-cs-regimen-line-second\"> </a></td><td>Second-line regimen</td><td>The client is receiving a second-line ART regimen.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">regimen-line-third<a name=\"ng-hiv-int-lab-form-cs-regimen-line-third\"> </a></td><td>Third-line regimen</td><td>The client is receiving a third-line ART regimen.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">vl-indication-baseline-six-months<a name=\"ng-hiv-int-lab-form-cs-vl-indication-baseline-six-months\"> </a></td><td>Baseline: six months after ART initiation</td><td>Baseline viral-load testing six months after ART initiation.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">vl-indication-routine-annual<a name=\"ng-hiv-int-lab-form-cs-vl-indication-routine-annual\"> </a></td><td>Routine: every 12 months</td><td>Routine annual viral-load monitoring.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">vl-indication-clinical-immunologic-failure<a name=\"ng-hiv-int-lab-form-cs-vl-indication-clinical-immunologic-failure\"> </a></td><td>Clinical or immunologic failure</td><td>Viral-load testing requested because of suspected clinical or immunologic treatment failure.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">vl-indication-gestation-32-36-weeks<a name=\"ng-hiv-int-lab-form-cs-vl-indication-gestation-32-36-weeks\"> </a></td><td>32–36 weeks of gestation</td><td>Viral-load testing requested at 32–36 weeks of gestation.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">vl-indication-confirmation-after-eac<a name=\"ng-hiv-int-lab-form-cs-vl-indication-confirmation-after-eac\"> </a></td><td>Confirmation: three to six months after EAC</td><td>Confirmatory viral-load testing three to six months after enhanced adherence counselling.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">vl-indication-recent-infection<a name=\"ng-hiv-int-lab-form-cs-vl-indication-recent-infection\"> </a></td><td>Recent infection</td><td>Viral-load testing requested in the context of recent HIV infection.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">vl-indication-early-hiv-detection<a name=\"ng-hiv-int-lab-form-cs-vl-indication-early-hiv-detection\"> </a></td><td>Early HIV detection</td><td>Viral-load testing requested for early HIV detection.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">eid-indication-at-birth<a name=\"ng-hiv-int-lab-form-cs-eid-indication-at-birth\"> </a></td><td>EID at birth</td><td>Early infant diagnosis requested at birth.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">eid-indication-six-eight-weeks<a name=\"ng-hiv-int-lab-form-cs-eid-indication-six-eight-weeks\"> </a></td><td>EID at 6–8 weeks</td><td>Early infant diagnosis requested at six to eight weeks.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">eid-indication-two-twelve-months<a name=\"ng-hiv-int-lab-form-cs-eid-indication-two-twelve-months\"> </a></td><td>EID at 2–12 months</td><td>Early infant diagnosis requested between two and twelve months.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">eid-indication-repeat-invalid<a name=\"ng-hiv-int-lab-form-cs-eid-indication-repeat-invalid\"> </a></td><td>Repeat because of invalid test</td><td>The EID test is repeated because a previous result was invalid.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">eid-indication-after-breastfeeding<a name=\"ng-hiv-int-lab-form-cs-eid-indication-after-breastfeeding\"> </a></td><td>Repeat after cessation of breastfeeding</td><td>Repeat EID at least six weeks after the last exposure to breast milk.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">specimen-whole-blood<a name=\"ng-hiv-int-lab-form-cs-specimen-whole-blood\"> </a></td><td>Whole blood</td><td>Whole-blood specimen.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">specimen-plasma<a name=\"ng-hiv-int-lab-form-cs-specimen-plasma\"> </a></td><td>Plasma</td><td>Plasma specimen.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">specimen-dbs<a name=\"ng-hiv-int-lab-form-cs-specimen-dbs\"> </a></td><td>DBS</td><td>Dried blood spot specimen.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">specimen-pbs<a name=\"ng-hiv-int-lab-form-cs-specimen-pbs\"> </a></td><td>PBS</td><td>PBS as printed on the source form; the expansion is not specified by the source workbook.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">other-test-cd4-count<a name=\"ng-hiv-int-lab-form-cs-other-test-cd4-count\"> </a></td><td>CD4+ cell count</td><td>Absolute CD4+ cell count.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">other-test-cd4-percentage<a name=\"ng-hiv-int-lab-form-cs-other-test-cd4-percentage\"> </a></td><td>CD4 percentage</td><td>CD4 percentage.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">other-test-cd4-lfa<a name=\"ng-hiv-int-lab-form-cs-other-test-cd4-lfa\"> </a></td><td>CD4 LFA</td><td>CD4 lateral-flow assay.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">other-test-tb-lf-lam<a name=\"ng-hiv-int-lab-form-cs-other-test-tb-lf-lam\"> </a></td><td>TB LF-LAM</td><td>Tuberculosis lateral-flow urine lipoarabinomannan test.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">other-test-serum-crag<a name=\"ng-hiv-int-lab-form-cs-other-test-serum-crag\"> </a></td><td>Serum CrAg</td><td>Serum cryptococcal antigen test.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">other-test-csf-crag<a name=\"ng-hiv-int-lab-form-cs-other-test-csf-crag\"> </a></td><td>CSF CrAg</td><td>Cerebrospinal-fluid cryptococcal antigen test.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">other-test-csf-mcs<a name=\"ng-hiv-int-lab-form-cs-other-test-csf-mcs\"> </a></td><td>CSF M/C/S</td><td>Cerebrospinal-fluid microscopy, culture and sensitivity.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">other-test-hbsag<a name=\"ng-hiv-int-lab-form-cs-other-test-hbsag\"> </a></td><td>HBsAg</td><td>Hepatitis B surface antigen test.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">other-test-hcv-antibody<a name=\"ng-hiv-int-lab-form-cs-other-test-hcv-antibody\"> </a></td><td>HCV antibody</td><td>Hepatitis C virus antibody test.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">other-test-hbv-viral-load<a name=\"ng-hiv-int-lab-form-cs-other-test-hbv-viral-load\"> </a></td><td>HBV viral load</td><td>Hepatitis B virus viral-load test.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">other-test-hcv-viral-load<a name=\"ng-hiv-int-lab-form-cs-other-test-hcv-viral-load\"> </a></td><td>HCV viral load</td><td>Hepatitis C virus viral-load test.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">other-test-syphilis<a name=\"ng-hiv-int-lab-form-cs-other-test-syphilis\"> </a></td><td>Syphilis</td><td>Syphilis serology.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">other-test-hpv<a name=\"ng-hiv-int-lab-form-cs-other-test-hpv\"> </a></td><td>HPV</td><td>Human papillomavirus test.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">other-test-cytology<a name=\"ng-hiv-int-lab-form-cs-other-test-cytology\"> </a></td><td>Cytology</td><td>Cytology or cervical-screening test, including VIA or Pap smear as printed on the source form.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">other-test-random-glucose<a name=\"ng-hiv-int-lab-form-cs-other-test-random-glucose\"> </a></td><td>Random glucose</td><td>Random blood-glucose test.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">other-test-naat<a name=\"ng-hiv-int-lab-form-cs-other-test-naat\"> </a></td><td>NAAT</td><td>Nucleic-acid amplification test; the target organism is not specified on the source form.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">other-test-urinalysis<a name=\"ng-hiv-int-lab-form-cs-other-test-urinalysis\"> </a></td><td>Urinalysis</td><td>Urinalysis.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">result-negative<a name=\"ng-hiv-int-lab-form-cs-result-negative\"> </a></td><td>Negative</td><td>The qualitative laboratory result is negative.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">result-positive<a name=\"ng-hiv-int-lab-form-cs-result-positive\"> </a></td><td>Positive</td><td>The qualitative laboratory result is positive.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">result-invalid<a name=\"ng-hiv-int-lab-form-cs-result-invalid\"> </a></td><td>Invalid</td><td>The test result is invalid.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">result-non-reactive<a name=\"ng-hiv-int-lab-form-cs-result-non-reactive\"> </a></td><td>Non-reactive</td><td>The serology result is non-reactive.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">result-reactive<a name=\"ng-hiv-int-lab-form-cs-result-reactive\"> </a></td><td>Reactive</td><td>The serology result is reactive.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">cytology-method-via<a name=\"ng-hiv-int-lab-form-cs-cytology-method-via\"> </a></td><td>VIA</td><td>Visual inspection with acetic acid.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">cytology-method-pap-smear<a name=\"ng-hiv-int-lab-form-cs-cytology-method-pap-smear\"> </a></td><td>Pap smear</td><td>Papanicolaou cervical cytology.</td></tr></table></div>"
